    "PID:Slot 2:Advanced:i Zone"
	fD readwrite	29	  21
	"PID Slot 2 Advanced i Zone: The error zone where accumulation is helpful to control versus where it should be reset to avoid further instability."	"REVSpark_Properties.html"	"..\..\help\REVSpark_Reference.chm"

