    "PID:Slot 3:Advanced:All Elements"
	cluster { 4, "i Zone" = fD, "max I Accum" = fD, "d Filter"=fD, "error Limit"=fD } readwrite	29	  215
	"PID Slot 3 Advanced Settings: The error zone where accumulation is helpful to control versus where it should be reset to avoid further instability. Max limits how large accumulated integral error can become, d filter can keep sensor noise from destabilizing control, and a limit on the error term before PID calculation."	"REVSpark_Properties.html"	"..\..\help\REVSpark_Reference.chm"

